    <string name="spd_help_title">How to Play Spider Solitaire</string>
    <string name="spd_help_text">Clear the table by building eight runs of one suit, from King down to Ace.\n\nBuild columns downward in any suit: a card goes on a card one rank higher. Move a run (cards of ONE suit in descending order) by dragging it, or tap it and then tap a column.\n\nWhen no column is empty, deal a new row from the stock onto every column. A finished King-to-Ace run in one suit leaves the table. Clear all eight runs to win.\n\nUndo is unlimited, and Hint shows a good move.</string>
